<div class="sec" id="s9">
  <div class="num">09</div>
  <h2>Cheat sheet</h2>
  <p class="lede">Print this panel and stick it next to the screen.</p>
  <div class="cheat">
    <h3>Getting going with AI: cheat sheet</h3>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="blk">
        <div class="h">The loop</div><p>
          Prompt writer in Claude chat, then thread in Delta, then read the
          plan, then approve, then review, then comment or accept.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="blk">
        <div class="h">Prompt anatomy</div><ul>
          <li>Goal</li><li>Context (the intern test)</li><li>
            Constraints ("don't finish until")
          </li><li>What done looks like</li><li>Output format</li><li>
            Example
          </li><li>Give it the goal, not the steps</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="blk">
        <div class="h">Claude Code commands</div><ul>
          <li><code>cd</code> then drag folder in: go to the project</li><li>
            <code>claude</code>: start Claude Code
          </li><li><code>/init</code>: create a CLAUDE.md</li><li>
            <code>/help</code>: list commands
          </li><li><code>/clear</code>: fresh conversation</li><li>
            "Show me a plan first": always
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="blk">
        <div class="h">Delta flow</div><ul>
          <li>Open project</li><li>New thread, one small ask</li><li>
            Read plan, ok it
          </li><li>Review the changes</li><li>
            Comment on the line or message
          </li><li>Accept, then new thread</li><li>
            Share the link when stuck
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="blk">
        <div class="h">Zed setup</div><ul>
          <li>Install from zed.dev, open folder</li><li>
            Open the Agent Panel
          </li><li>Add Agent, Install from Registry, Claude Agent</li><li>
            New thread, type <code>/login</code>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="blk">
        <div class="h">Safety</div><ul>
          <li>No secrets in prompts</li><li>Read every plan</li><li>
            One project folder
          </li><li>Separate copies or Git</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--color-5a4d33)">
      Live docs: docs.claude.com, delta.dev/docs, zed.dev/docs
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
